## Performance Monitoring

### Core Web Vitals
- Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) < 2.5s
- First Input Delay (FID) < 100ms
- Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) < 0.1

### Monitoring Tools
- Vercel Analytics
- Google Analytics
- Custom performance monitoring
